{"title": "Herb Supply Table", "pageid": 14011, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Herb_Supply_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Herb Supply Table</b>, also known as <code>Supply_Alchemy_Herbs</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Alchemy_Herbs+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supply_Alchemy_Herbs+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains common herb-like alchemical ingredients. It is implemented as 2-5 rolls on the <a href=\"/wiki/Herb_Subtable\" title=\"Herb Subtable\">Herb Subtable</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Herb Supply Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p><p><i>Rolls 2-5 times on the <a href=\"/wiki/Herb_Subtable\" title=\"Herb Subtable\">Herb Subtable</a>. The average roll on the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Herb Supply Table</a> is 3.4 herbs.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>1/5</td><td>2/5</td><td>1/5</td><td>1/5</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Up to level 5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Autumncrocus\" title=\"Autumncrocus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png/40px-Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png/60px-Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/cb/Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png/40px-Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Autumncrocus_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Autumncrocus\" title=\"Autumncrocus\">Autumncrocus</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/9</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Belladonna\" title=\"Belladonna\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Belladonna_Item_Icon.png/40px-Belladonna_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Belladonna_Item_Icon.png/60px-Belladonna_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a9/Belladonna_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Belladonna_Item_Icon.png/40px-Belladonna_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Belladonna_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Belladonna\" title=\"Belladonna\">Belladonna</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align: